    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess i see what you mean about control. like, everything else in my life has just fallen apart and i've had no say in any of it. but if i actually did it... if i really just let go like you're saying... would it really be enough to stop the impact i'm having? like, would they actually be able to move on and be happy, or would i just be leaving them with a different kind of weight?",
